# Developer-only files that must not be shipped to the App Store.
#
# NOTE: this file cannot exclude scoped packages (node_modules/@types etc.) —
# the Homey CLI ignores such patterns. Dev dependencies are kept out of the
# published package by pruning them first; see the `prepack` script in
# package.json and the publishing note in README.md.

# Build-time image tooling (sharp) is only used by this script to render
# App Store preview images on a developer machine.
scripts/

# Developer documentation. The App Store reads readme.txt / readme.de.txt.
docs/
README.md
